  "properties": {
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "You’re tuning a classifier to identify toxic berries. A ranger wants to make sure people don’t accidentally eat toxic berries.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Find the threshold that maximizes the model’s accuracy.\r\n- Find the threshold that maximizes the model’s recall.\r\n- Find the threshold that maximizes the model’s precision.\r\n- Find the best threshold for the model. Be ready to justify your choice.",
